      "content": "thanks for the breakdown. you were saying \"the inconsistency you're experiencing is likely due to the fact...\"—could you finish that thought? \n\ni'm trying to figure out if there's a specific pattern or condition that dictates when it flips between a view and a copy. is it related to the memory layout or how the slice is constructed? also, you mentioned \"caches\" earlier, can you expand on how that plays into the memory addressing issue?",
      "source": "evaluator"
